Nelo TV Launcher is an independently implemented Kotlin/Android launcher.
No source code, artwork, icons or binaries were copied from FLauncher,
LTvLauncher, Apple, Netflix, Amazon or Spotify. Application icons are loaded
at runtime from installed applications and remain their owners' property.
FLauncher and LTvLauncher were evaluated as alternatives; their GPLv3 code
is not incorporated into this project. See docs/RESEARCH.md for sources.

Runtime dependency: Kotlin standard library 2.0.21, JetBrains s.r.o. and Kotlin
Programming Language contributors, Apache License 2.0 (licenses/).
The Gradle wrapper (Gradle, Inc. and contributors) is Apache License 2.0.
Android framework APIs are supplied by the device, not bundled in this APK.
